Sep 20
3 rows had insured damage exceeding total damage (JAM 2024, JPN 2007, USA 2015 — all storms/wildfire); removed as impossible. 683 → 680.
Missing values in model variables: log_gdp 20, credit_gdp 66, rule_of_law 30. 680 → 593 rows.
Hazard categories with fewer than 10 events (Drought 8, Extreme temperature 7, Mass movement 4) dropped to avoid a rank-deficient design matrix. 593 → 574.
Baseline: 574 events, R² 0.475. Rule of law strongest predictor (−0.102, p=0.005); income weak once institutions controlled (−0.052, p=0.095).
VIFs all below 5 — the three explanations are separable in this sample.
Fractional logit agrees with OLS on signs and significance throughout.






